            <img src="http://www2.chemistry.msu.edu/faculty/reusch/VirtTxtJml/Images/arrow2.gif" style="max-width:748px;" /></td>
            <td class="mt-noheading" nowrap="nowrap"><br />
            p-O<sub>2</sub>N&ndash;C<sub>6</sub>H<sub>4</sub>&ndash;NH</td>
